:Amateur Radio Web Resources. Ham Software Index (Hamware) - Windows, DOS, Linux. http://personal3.iddeo.es/ea3qp/soft1.html

- - -

Amateur Packet Radio Contacts - TCP/IP in packet radio. Introduction to Packet Radio by Greg Jones, WD5IVD: History, Why Packet?, Elements of a Packet Station, What is AX.25?, Protocols, Network Schemes, BBS Message Transfer, TCP/IP-Linux.
:http://www.tapr.org/tapr/html/pktfaq.html
